# Storybook (`packages/ui`)

See also **`storybook-ui-stories.mdc`** (canvas copy, colocation), **`readboot-scss-architecture.mdc`** (tokens / framework / components), **`deprecation-patterns-and-styles.mdc`**.

## Where stories live

- **`packages/ui/src/Tokens/`** — token demos. Sidebar root **Tokens** (`titlePrefix` in `apps/storybook/.storybook/main.ts`).
- **`packages/ui/src/Framework/`** — framework UI + colocated stories. Sidebar **Framework**.
- **`packages/ui/src/patterns/`** — legacy library stories still on disk for product use; in Storybook they appear under sidebar root **Wire frames** (same `titlePrefix`; not labeled “patterns”).
- **`packages/ui/src/components/`** — greenfield feature UI; colocated `*.stories.*` show under sidebar **Components** when present.

## Sidebar & capitalization (what we decided)

1. **Top-level groups (fixed labels):** **`Tokens`**, **`Framework`**, **`Wire frames`** (legacy `patterns/` on disk), **`Components`**, enforced by `titlePrefix` on each `stories` directory entry in **`main.ts`**. Manager **`sidebar.showRoots: false`** so labels render in normal case (not all-caps).
2. **Under each group:** sidebar follows **filesystem** path segments after the prefix (e.g. `Framework/Atoms/Logo/LogoImage`). On-disk greenfield roots use **PascalCase** **`Tokens/`**, **`Framework/`**, then **`Atoms/`**, **`Molecules/`**, **`Organisms/`**, and domain subfolders (**`Logo/`**, **`Interactive/`**, **`Spatial/`**, …).
3. **Story exports:** use **PascalCase** export names (`Default`, `WithAccent`, …) — see **`storybook-ui-stories.mdc`**.
4. **Optional display `name` on a story** (sentence case for humans only) is fine; do **not** use **`title` on `meta`** for sidebar placement — use file location + `titlePrefix` instead. ESLint: **`storybook/no-title-property-in-meta`** stays on for `@repo/ui` story files.

## Global styles in the canvas

- **`preview.ts`** imports **`packages/ui/src/Framework/framework.scss`** (same bundle apps use via `@repo/ui/framework`), not `patterns/globals.scss`.

## Hoisting / “redundant naming” (Storybook default)

- Storybook may **collapse** a folder and a single story file when names match after normalization (often case-insensitive). Prefer natural names: `ComponentName/ComponentName.stories.tsx` next to `ComponentName.tsx`.

## ESLint

- `storybook/no-title-property-in-meta` — do not add `title` to story `meta` (use **`titlePrefix`** in `main.ts` for top-level groups only).

## Branding assets (SSOT)

- **Logo and favicon** — `packages/ui/src/assets/branding/`. Story-only art — `packages/ui/src/assets/storybook/`. Storybook `staticDirs` serves `packages/ui/src/assets` at `/assets/...`. Do not use external placeholder image URLs in stories.

## Fonts (canvas parity)

- Match app layout Google Fonts in **`apps/storybook/.storybook/preview-head.html`**.
